      "document": "docs/design-basis/README.md",
      "scope": "Self-contained academic report with an eight-page PDF and editable manuscript. The original six A4 portrait pages retain their content; two A4 landscape pages add publication-view architecture and local/cloud deployment diagrams embedded as vectors. Diagram DOT/SVG/PNG assets are versioned alongside the report; the user-renamed PDF path is preserved. Preserves the initial 100 machines x 1 reading/s and scale-ready design. No requirement, runtime, wire, SQL, default or retention change; target diagrams are not evidence of deployment or measured capacity.",
